#: ../../../headers/math/index.md:397
msgid ""
"Exhaustive tests check every representable point in the input space. This "
"method is used for half-precision functions and single-precision univariate "
"functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/math/index.md:398
msgid ""
"Randomized tests check a large, deterministic subset of the input space, "
"typically using 2{sup}`32` samples. This method is used for functions with "
"larger input spaces, such as single-precision bivariate and double-precision "
"functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/math/index.md:399
msgid ""
"ULP tolerances are based on The Khronos Group, [The OpenCL C Specification "
"v3.0.19](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenCL/specs/3.0-unified/html/"
"OpenCL_C.html), Sec. 7.4, Khronos Registry [July 10, 2025]."
msgstr ""

